  "project_description": "WAYF (Where Are You From)\n\n This is the Drupal 10 version of the https://www.drupal.org/project/wayf_dk_login module.\n\n WAYF is a Danish SAML based Single Sign-On system which permits using one single login to access several web based services. WAYF creates connections between the login systems at the connected institutions and external web based services. \n\n Read more about WAYF at http://wayf.dk/en",
